# Terraform working dirs, local state (bootstrap/ keeps its state locally), plans, and per-device tuning.
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
**/*.tfvars.json
**/terraform.tfvars.*
!**/terraform.tfvars.example
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log

models/*
!models/README.md

# macOS Finder metadata.
.DS_Store

# Python bytecode from test runs.
**/__pycache__/

# Local environment settings; examples remain publishable.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

# Logs and private credential files.
*.log
logs/
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx

# Private model-profile copies and backups; profiles.json stays public.
/shared/model-profiles/profiles.local.json
/shared/model-profiles/profiles.private.json
/shared/model-profiles/profiles.json.*
